<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.42 vs   0.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.72 vs   1.85</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.43 vs   2.28</p>
<p> Sales		   15.79 vs  12.52</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.26 vs   9.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.80 vs  15.04</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.22 vs  18.61</p>
<p> Sales		  142.71 vs 121.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
